Package code is licensed under the MIT License in LICENSE, and so is the
compilation of wilayas, dairas, communes, their bilingual names, postal codes and
administrative codes. Three parts of the data are not: two derived from
OpenStreetMap, and the mirrored postal data under data/poste/.

The two parts derived from OpenStreetMap are made available under the Open
